@startuml US_3_2_4_RBAC
title US 3.2.4 - Restrição por role (front + back)

actor SPA as "SPA (AuthGuard)"
participant API as "TodoApi pipeline"
participant Mid as "NetworkRestrictionMiddleware"
participant Authz as "ASP.NET Authorization"
participant Ctrl as "Example: ResourcesController"
database DB as "PortContext"

SPA -> API: GET /api/Resources (auth cookie)
API -> Mid: Invoke
Mid -> DB: valida AppUser ativo + roles
DB --> Mid: ok ou none
alt sem role/ativo
  Mid --> SPA: 403 {"message": ...}
  SPA -> SPA: mostrar Access Denied page/toast
else permitido
  Mid --> API: next
  API -> Authz: [Authorize] / policies (role checks)
  Authz --> Ctrl: allowed
  Ctrl -> DB: operação
  DB --> Ctrl: dados
  Ctrl --> SPA: 200 / 204
end

SPA -> AuthGuard: antes de renderizar rota\nverifica data.roles e role do user
alt role não permitido
  AuthGuard --> SPA: redirect / (toast "Acesso negado")
end

@enduml
